    "content": "We propose the novel DLAdapter framework to enable the SFDLA task. DLAdapterbuilds on a standard object detection architecture that has been trained on source-domain documents. Given only the pre-trained weights and unlabeled target-domainimages, DLAdapter performs self-supervised adaptation without accessing source data.Fig. 5 presents the core components of DLAdapter:",
